[{"title":"送王兖州","author":"刘攽","text":"卧阁偏州独老夫，三年化尽白髭须。\n故人始得班荆语，督府相观剖竹符。\n旧学翰林君子泽，雄文策府列仙儒。\n蛟龙莫作池中物，老骥几为辕下驹。\n腰底印章驰传乘，道傍冠盖弃关繻。\n黄金上冢家相乐，文弩迎官吏疾驱。\n甲子可怜同步武，光阴稍觉近桑榆。\n挂车正尔思前路，毕娶由来异壮图。\n笑谑会须矜此酒，分飞何必待长涂。\n侧身东望艰梁甫，犹冀君家有只凫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41262,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宋职方新脩厅事","author":"刘攽","text":"事从梁栋拯隳颓，民有馀工库有财。\n不待公输洎玉茧，肯论新甫与徂徕。\n经营结构无遗巧，壮丽宏深要必该。\n广砌水平铺淡碧，应门风过绝纤埃。\n云山喷墨文屏合，金兽衔环洞户开。\n势似名翚飞夭矫，喜知巢燕到裴徊。\n陈平社宰非无意，薛惠邮亭信不才。\n会道曹风如鲁卫，辅州元作帝京陪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41263,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和宋职方","author":"刘攽","text":"万缘冥数有兴颓，不为劳民与费财。\n常怪丘渊犹改旧，足令蓍蔡可知来。\n黄图左辅今仍重，甲令名藩此正该。\n过去英贤联踵武，几多能事悉尘埃。\n僝工匠石三农隙，唾手公堂一旦开。\n妙选栋梁虹宛转，触新廊庑雁徘徊。\n落成幸有羔羊酒，能赋欣逢锦绘才。\n衰老专城无异术，祇将勤拙任家陪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41264,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬李推官","author":"刘攽","text":"少无风力致云霄，老寄东藩愧节旄。\n涉境已怜清济涸，开门犹喜岱山高。\n智微黑蚁穿珠窍，术异游鱼出鼎膏。\n思古循良深自叹，视身尸素欲何逃。\n流光去去车驰毂，过事新新海驾涛。\n屈指家声欢上客，惬心风什幸诗豪。\n青春小圃饶佳卉，迟日芳樽付浊醪。\n倾盖强君留一醉，相看前路钓连鳌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41265,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答郑秘丞见寄长韵","author":"刘攽","text":"郑公真率故难攀，夙昔相期季孟间。\n昼锦乡闾嗤拓落，藉糟官局压清閒。\n饮肠纵逸卮无当，诗句清新玉作环。\n屡舞自矜能举袖，少歌谁复顾酡颜。\n南金不足偿棋进，鲁酒频闻输罚锾。\n豪忤里儒连束矢，狂侵醉尉欲翘关。\n婢勤织衽几无欲，男饱诗书仅有鳏。\n疲马踏泥如得绊，弱弓支肘不成弯。\n权材未恨原中秘，领邑那知寄百蛮。\n说将正怜胡越异，问津空复鬓毛斑。\n江连楚蜀无穷水，路绕巴渝不尽山。\n青嶂叫猿寒寂寂，乱泉冲石暝潺潺。\n有生谁得辞羁旅，良苦遥知冒险艰。\n高兴由来向人尽，尺书仍喜不吾悭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41266,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨后小园","author":"刘攽","text":"雨多三径似荒郊，处处秋阴紫翠交。\n照水白莲霜雪朵，倚天乔木夕阳梢。\n池光俯见游鱼窟，楼角遥临宿羽巢。\n倚杖移时看蚁斗，操舟缭岸试杯胶。\n墙阴静色怜甘菊，垣上悬藤识苦匏。\n老圃不须讥抱瓮，野人无事伴诛茅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41267,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"终南山","author":"刘攽","text":"终南际沧海，千里张屏风。\n落月沈山西，朝阳生岭东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41268,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"火浣坛","author":"刘攽","text":"天游神不虚，火解形复见。\n明明学道心，不与劫火变。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41269,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"许真君祠","author":"刘攽","text":"旧怪神仙事，燕齐得浪传。\n丹青此堂上，想像为依然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41270,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒舫","author":"刘攽","text":"美酒留人饮，乘风纵客槎。\n秋潭夜深月，春屿雨馀花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41271,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹冈","author":"刘攽","text":"夤缘映层阜，苍翠复春苔。\n君知爱霜雪，若个是龙材。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41272,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食后闻雁","author":"刘攽","text":"后雁来何暮，春风万里情。\n江南多燕子，无处觅同声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41273,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丹井","author":"刘攽","text":"古井玄泉色，仙人玉镜寒。\n照来知骨相，作意就金丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41274,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初夜","author":"刘攽","text":"栖鸡已登屋，宿羽复归林。\n不语听钟坐，默默千里心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41275,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡楼晚坐同陈掾","author":"刘攽","text":"云来湖外雨，楼倚树梢风。\n不惜清凉意，持将与子同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41276,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人日立春","author":"刘攽","text":"花胜已宜春，剪綵更为人。\n风光今日好，颜貌一时新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41277,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"赤骥脱馵羁，轩然视瑶池。\n公持汉使节，不减豸冠时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41278,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其二","author":"刘攽","text":"三江互东南，波浪浮日光。\n峡中起奔涛，积钱仅成塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41279,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其三","author":"刘攽","text":"吴帆若飞鸿，千里长风生。\n组练白玉粒，一月来上京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41280,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其四","author":"刘攽","text":"利术析秋毫，心计游无垠。\n亦有甘棠荫，蔽芾如旧春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41281,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其五","author":"刘攽","text":"忽为严霜诛，惨戚动秋草。\n狐狸不足问，豺狼讵横道。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41282,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其六","author":"刘攽","text":"诸公惜分手，置酒倚名园。\n长廊蔽修景，昼无车马喧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41283,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其七","author":"刘攽","text":"露光洗高花，风力曳垂柳。\n上客请赋诗，主人起为寿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41284,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其八","author":"刘攽","text":"春浓芳菲杂，日夕境气变。\n望望樯上乌，去去令人羡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41285,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其九","author":"刘攽","text":"壮年吴会游，常有怀远情。\n想见瓜步南，草长莺乱鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41286,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送韩玉汝司封奉使两浙闻诸公先分题用池塘生春草园柳变鸣禽字合为十章四句 其十","author":"刘攽","text":"驿骑传梅花，书帖封来禽。\n何以慰别愁，迟此瑶华音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41287,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"花屿","author":"刘攽","text":"孤绝池心屿，高低水面花。\n若无舟楫到，应似隔仙家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41288,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池上","author":"刘攽","text":"罢客棋仍在，留书卷未终。\n荷喧知过雨，萍聚见来风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41289,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"啸台","author":"刘攽","text":"高台见百里，长啸海风生。\n为问尘埃耳，能闻鸾鹤声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41290,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鼎池","author":"刘攽","text":"仙去遗金鼎，年深认劫灰。\n怀人何限意，时向鼎池来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41291,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"故人谢师厚刻唐贤淳于先生墓诗于善谑驿系语其后刻石后二年师厚去世明年余过善谑驿读诗悲之因作淳于墓诗又题二韵追悼师厚平生忘形善谑莫逆惟师厚为然也","author":"刘攽","text":"故人坟宿草，翰墨想遗风。\n善谑知君意，何伤睿武公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41292,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与持国约游环溪大风不果往又过曾氏值主人之病","author":"刘攽","text":"人事不如意，出门安可期。\n终须赏春物，那问主人为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41293,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲池","author":"刘攽","text":"莲花水底红，荷叶岸边风。\n五月蝉鸣后，君应爱此中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41294,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东楼","author":"刘攽","text":"楼前淮水上，远树似鱼鳞。\n来帆与去棹，肠断倚栏人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41295,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长门曲 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"凝笳来凤辇，玉宇开深殿。\n君恩春风回，那向秋时怨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer"