不得归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41309,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九蕊芙蓉","author":"刘攽","text":"托根不近芙蓉苑，移植犹依瘴疠乡。\n并蕊连心九相似，看来还使九回肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41310,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月吉日涧上望芙蓉因寻菊今岁特晚青蕊未作怃然有怀","author":"刘攽","text":"百芳不奈秋风急，唯有芙蓉特拒霜。\n本以南州积炎德，一为名误客殊方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41311,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄关西兄弟","author":"刘攽","text":"晓风吹尽淮南雪，昨夜汀州白芷生。\n遥想春光西北去，倩传相忆向秦城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41312,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阊阖台 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"看雪望春何处好，城腰山腹暂来登。\n人知容足无馀愿，便是章华与九层。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41313,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阊阖台 其二","author":"刘攽","text":"红日骎骎还暗夜，轻车去去只微尘。\n老夫独立聊观化，惊怪往来无限人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41314,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅雨","author":"刘攽","text":"梅实初黄暮雨深，宝刀生锈镜昏沈。\n年年卑湿身无病，自觉能胜百鍊金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41315,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐语三首呈通判库部 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"梧上生枝复隔年，白头倾盖两欢然。\n满城童子垂髫发，竹马羊车戏路边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41316,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐语三首呈通判库部 其二","author":"刘攽","text":"邯郸度曲尽新声，稚萼韶华稍向荣。\n珠箔曲钩遮密坐，瑶台静室伴深行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41317,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐语三首呈通判库部 其三","author":"刘攽","text":"宫柳飞花暗度春，斛愁容贮奈伤神。\n曼声试作鸡鸣曲，何必阳关无故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41318,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新开湖上待潜珠不出偶书戏孙莘老二首 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"贝阙藏珠安在哉，九渊深绝若为媒。\n风波可畏且归去，漫道扁舟湖上来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41319,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新开湖上待潜珠不出偶书戏孙莘老二首 其二","author":"刘攽","text":"合浦因人去不还，隋侯未值报恩年。\n欲凭泉客传微信，夜久凉风月满川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41320,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入汜水寄仲冯","author":"刘攽","text":"沙起河津迷积雾，云遮晚日怯层山。\n客行正似摴蒱局，叠马来过第二关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41321,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新燕","author":"刘攽","text":"主人恩厚与相依，画栋危檐昼启扉。\n岂是有心希鹄雁，众雏成就即归飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41322,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出都","author":"刘攽","text":"王孙莲勺卤中困，文叔芜蒌亭下寒。\n尘俗岂知湖海士，敝裘羸马出长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41323,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"致斋太常寺以杖画地成二首 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"少有閒人访寂寥，薄云淡日早春朝。\n庭花弄蕊萱生笋，时见东风趁柳条。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41324,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"致斋太常寺以杖画地成二首 其二","author":"刘攽","text":"杖藤为笔沙为纸，閒立庭前试草书。\n无奈春风犹掣肘，等閒撩乱入衣裾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41325,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宁陵陂 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"十里菰蒲百顷陂，秋风袅袅荡涟漪。\n旅游已信江湖远，水国犹将昼梦疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41326,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宁陵陂 其二","author":"刘攽","text":"屈钩结网老农妻，鼓楫鸣榔旧牧儿。\n世事谁令山海变，可怜机械亦相随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41327,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长春花","author":"刘攽","text":"雪霜雨露平分尽，旧紫新红次第开。\n自是馀花芳意薄，那知春去不重来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41328,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次子由韵三首 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"流霞饮过已忘寒，和笔螭坳墨色乾。\n温室前头问名木，此身知不误儒冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41329,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次子由韵三首 其二","author":"刘攽","text":"四朝传说直臣言，万事多君与轾轩。\n重到彤墀挥翰处，想知云梦一时吞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41330,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次子由韵三首 其三","author":"刘攽","text":"华光劝讲想天临，白发儒先遇主心。\n仍寄史臣挥直笔，圣谟文思与几深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41331,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊淮上","author":"刘攽","text":"风波缭绕半天下，鬓发苍筤一丈夫。\n惆怅江湖向时月，又来淮浦照樯乌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41332,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久旱作问诗 其一","author":"刘攽","text":"问云何意复归山，应恃无心欲占閒。\n我为閒多忙折我，劝云为雨莫空还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41333,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久旱作问诗 其二","author":"刘攽","text":"问风何意扫云开，本为虞琴唤汝来。\n桑麦青乾天不雨，更将何物阜民财。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41334,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久旱作问诗 其三","author":"刘攽","text":"问山何意及郊农，天欲为霖不见容。\n少闭土囊诛啸虎，也教云气得从龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41335,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]